#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:212
msgid "For a clean port to v2.1.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Pour un portage propre vers v2.1.0, le travail habituel est :"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:214
msgid ""
"Replace ``image.FREAK`` with ``image.ORB``, drop the descriptor-type "
"argument, and update ``match_descriptor()`` tuple unpacking / "
"``draw_keypoints()`` to the keypoints object (:ref:`the ORB rework "
"<v2_1_0_orb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Remplacer ``image.FREAK`` par ``image.ORB``, supprimer l'argument de type de"
" descripteur, et mettre à jour le déballage du tuple de "
"``match_descriptor()`` / ``draw_keypoints()`` vers l'objet de points clés "
"(:ref:`le remaniement ORB <v2_1_0_orb>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:218
msgid ""
"Rename ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` to the ``set_auto_*`` forms (:ref:`the auto-function"
" rename <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renommer ``sensor.set_whitebal()`` / ``set_gain_ctrl()`` / "
"``set_exposure_ctrl()`` vers les formes ``set_auto_*`` (:ref:`le renommage "
"des fonctions automatiques <v2_1_0_autofuncs>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:221
msgid ""
"Move histogram/statistics code to the object methods (:ref:`the "
"histogram/statistics rework <v2_1_0_histogram>`)."
msgstr ""
"Déplacer le code d'histogramme/statistiques vers les méthodes objets "
"(:ref:`le remaniement histogramme/statistiques <v2_1_0_histogram>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:223
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_features()`` ``scale=`` to ``scale_factor=`` (:ref:`the "
"find_features rename <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renommer ``scale=`` de ``find_features()`` en ``scale_factor=`` (:ref:`le "
"renommage de find_features <v2_1_0_findfeatures>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:225
msgid ""
"Use blob-object accessors and replace ``find_markers()`` with "
"``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (:ref:`the find_blobs change "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`); replace ``img.copy_to_fb()`` with the ``copy_to_fb=`` "
"keyword (:ref:`the copy_to_fb change <v2_1_0_copytofb>`)."
msgstr ""
"Utiliser les accesseurs d'objet blob et remplacer ``find_markers()`` par "
"``find_blobs(merge=True, ...)`` (:ref:`le changement de find_blobs "
"<v2_1_0_findblobs>`) ; remplacer ``img.copy_to_fb()`` par le mot-clé "
"``copy_to_fb=`` (:ref:`le changement de copy_to_fb <v2_1_0_copytofb>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:230
msgid ""
"Clamp ``compress()`` quality to 1–100 and re-check JPEG sizes on the OpenMV "
"3 (:ref:`the compress change <v2_1_0_compress>`); re-tune ``lens_corr()`` "
"zoom (:ref:`the lens_corr change <v2_1_0_lenscorr>`)."
msgstr ""
"Limiter la qualité de ``compress()`` à 1–100 et revérifier les tailles JPEG "
"sur l'OpenMV 3 (:ref:`le changement de compress <v2_1_0_compress>`) ; régler"
" à nouveau le zoom de ``lens_corr()`` (:ref:`le changement de lens_corr "
"<v2_1_0_lenscorr>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:234
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Tous les autres scripts s'exécutent sans modification."
